Error [E3303]: This freestanding program allocates memory but has no global allocator configured.
  --> tests/ui/freestanding_e3303.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     xs @= [1, 2, 3]
    |           ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `--freestanding` builds cannot use the OS heap; a custom allocator is required.
 Fix: Add `use core.mem;` and configure an arena or fixed allocator with `mem.set_allocator(…)`.
